# Build outputs
build/
build-xdp/
*.o
*.obj

# Generated benchmark/dataset artifacts
# WHY: dataset files are deterministic and regenerable via blitz_gen_dataset
#      given the same seed + config. Store seed/flags in datasets/manifest.txt
#      instead of committing the binary files themselves.
# WHY datasets/* + a negated exception (not a blanket datasets/ rule): a
#      bare "datasets/" ignores the whole directory, manifest.txt included
#      -- silently defeating the "store flags in manifest.txt instead"
#      policy this comment describes. This form ignores everything in the
#      directory except the one file meant to be tracked.
*.csv
results/
datasets/*
!datasets/manifest.txt

# CMake cache
compile_commands.json
.cache/
